  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Past a creepy wet flesh tunnel, the site opens into a huge world of primitive forest where fierce beasts roar and strange birds growl. The true Myriad Beast Fusion Color Heaven is vast and boundless.",
      "chapters": [
        2095
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside, a large tent of skin stands around a stone bed, with a huge pot hanging on a metal rack at the tent center.",
      "chapters": [
        2112
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meng Qiu Zhen, exploring a dream realm, is sent through a flesh tunnel whose inner walls are flesh and blood, with gastric acid flowing out. He arrives in a huge world of primitive forest, roaring beasts, and fighting beastman groups. The true site is vast and boundless. The dream is only a fragment of it. After the dream dissipates, his transformation path and wisdom path attainment levels have risen.",
      "chapters": [
        2095
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_meng_qiu_zhen"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hei Lou Lan wakes inside a beast-skin tent and is told she is here. Lu Tong Lan, Desolate Extremity of Longevity Heaven’s Eight Extremities, has been staying in this place as Blue Phoenix Tribe Leader. Countless tribes coexist with beasts, unlike the five regions, and gather every ten thousand years for the Myriad Tribes Ceremony. Reckless Savage Demon Venerable left his immortal aperture in the gluttonous demon frog, giving this grotto-heaven a food path environment. Under those food path dao marks, people eat Gu materials to raise dao marks and build totems, which are the mainstream cultivation method and the symbol of strength and status.",
      "chapters": [
        2112
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "interior-life",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
